{"id":"lorsque","lemma":"lorsque","pos":"conj","rank":862,"glosses":["when (at a time when)"],"ipa":"/lɔʁsk/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9a/Fr-lorsque.ogg/Fr-lorsque.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Je déteste lorsque ça arrive.","en":"I hate when that happens.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hate, to detest","l":"détester"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"to arrive","l":"arriver"}]},{"text":"Regarde-moi lorsque je te parle !","en":"Look at me when I'm talking to you!","words":[{"g":"to look at","l":"regarder"},{"g":"me"},null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to speak, talk","l":"parler"}]},{"text":"Fais-le lorsque tu en auras le temps.","en":"Do it when you have time.","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"time"}]},{"text":"Ramène-le lorsque tu as fini.","en":"Bring it back when you're done.","words":[{"g":"to take back","l":"ramener"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to finish","l":"finir"}]},{"text":"Que veux-tu faire lorsque tu seras grand ?","en":"What do you want to do when you grow up?","words":[{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to do"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"big"}]}]}